mx-master-4-desktop (0.1.0-2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Install the new mx4-playpause MPRIS helper (debian/rules) so the radial
    "Play / Pause" segment works from the packaged install.
  * control: depend on dbus-bin | dbus (mx4-show / mx4-playpause use dbus-send)
    and recommend qdbus-qt6 (provides the preferred qdbus6 fast path).
  * control: recommend liblayershellqtinterface6 | liblayershellqtinterface5 so
    the Wayland layer-shell runtime is pulled on trixie (6.x) as well as
    bookworm / Ubuntu 24.04 (5.x).
  * control: add qml6-module-qtquick-templates (QtQuick.Controls dependency).

